Recommended Daily Commands
git status
git pull --ff-only
git switch main
git switch <feature-branch>
git branch
git diff
git add .
git commit -m "Meaningful message"
git push
git log --oneline --graph --decorate --all

Notice that last command. It gives you a compact visual history of your branches and commits. As Project Ascent grows, it'll become one of your favorite ways to understand how the project evolved.

